189
00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:22,140
The first choice is a tried and true classic. But it doesn't apply in the situation. And it does sound a little cliché.

190
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:28,140
Option two is also out. If he escapes, he can't continue the conversation. Number three it is.

191
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:33,140
I agree. In this case three makes the most sense. She'll let him live and he'll get to know her better.

192
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:38,140
