228
00:14:56,140 --> 00:15:06,140
You said your name was Shido, right? And when you said you were interested in me, were you being serious?

229
00:15:06,140 --> 00:15:08,140
Yes, I was.

230
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,140
But like serious serious?

231
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,140
Serious serious.

232
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:14,140
100% serious serious?

233
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:25,140
Jerk! Who would seriously fall for your amateur tricks? Stupid dummy!

234
00:15:25,140 --> 00:15:27,140
But that was from the heart!

235
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:31,140
Then again, this is different. I still don't know what your intentions are.

236
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:35,140
But you are the only human I've ever had a normal conversation with.

237
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:39,140
You know this world which could serve me well. It might just work.

238
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:43,140
Yep, it's settled. This should prove your usefulness.

239
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:46,140
Thanks, I guess. Oh yeah, what was your name again?

240
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:49,140
My name? I've never had one of those.

241
00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:54,140
But I suppose I will need one if I want to find out why humans are so awful.

242
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:57,140
Okay, why don't you come up with something you can call me?

243
00:15:57,140 --> 00:16:00,140
